-- ============================================================================
-- DC30 - Basin & Charge PROFESSIONAL (intermediate tier) goes deep.
--
-- Flips (basin, intermediate) onto the DC1 deep path by inserting its ACTIVE
-- academy_course_structures row, generated from the repo manifest
-- src/content/courses/basin/intermediate/manifest.json (emitted by a
-- generator, not hand-typed), and seeding the six module quiz banks plus the
-- final exam. Answer keys live only here and in the table.
--
-- Six modules, 27 lessons: from a snapshot to a clock, the Easy%Ro scheme,
-- the heating ramp, the kerogen clock, reading a maturity, and the kinetics
-- workflow.
--
-- Every numeric item traces to the basin teaching oracle in
-- src/lib/basinTeaching.js over @petrolord/engines basin kinetics
-- (Sweeney-Burnham Easy%Ro + Type II kerogen), and reproduces the live NG11
-- Professional capstone answer key: ro_f0 0.20189651799465538, ro_full
-- 4.687971627022019, ro_150_r3 0.9871413464062039, ro_150_r1
-- 1.1129254516555198, tr_10 0.022481215976523083, tr_50 0.05477927380797565.
-- kineticsLab.test.js pins the panel math to those same values.
--
-- Tier positioning: the Associate tier (DC13) owns burial and heat (the
-- Sclater-Christie curve, decompaction, the steady two-layer column) and
-- forward-quotes "slow ramp wins" qualitatively; this tier owns the clock.
-- Both graded anchors are closed forms (exp(-1.6) and exp(-1.6 + 3.7 x 0.85),
-- the engine summing the twenty published weights in floating point to
-- 0.8500000000000003); the slow 1 C/Ma ramp reads 12.74 pct above the 3 C/Ma
-- ramp at the same 150 C because reaction is rate times residence; a maturity
-- threshold is not a temperature (Ro 0.5 is crossed at 86 / 92 / 99 C across
-- rates 1 / 3 / 10); the isothermal Type II clock STALLS (5x the time buys
-- 2.44x the conversion, the 48 kcal bin 70 pct drained while the 54 kcal peak
-- is untouched); and kerogen type spreads conversion 132x at 100 C / 50 Ma
-- while never moving Ro, the two-clock separation the tier teaches.
--
-- Bank standard: measured on the length RANK of the correct option and checked
-- for cyclic key sequences, answer-index skew, within-pool near-duplicates and
-- same-claim option pairs before seeding. Across the 132 questions the correct
-- option is longest in 4 pct and shortest in 9 pct.
--
-- Enrollment grandfathering: enforced_from defaults to now() on first insert;
-- the ON CONFLICT update deliberately leaves enforced_from unchanged.
--
-- Ladder note: an INTERMEDIATE enrollment needs an unrevoked ASSOCIATE
-- certification on the SAME app, so the dry-run probes back-stop a basin
-- associate cert in-transaction, and a P3b check proves the basin Associate
-- tier is left undisturbed at 132 questions.
--
-- New bs-kinetics-explorer panel. NO DDL. Data only.
-- ============================================================================

values ('basin', 'intermediate', '{"modules":[{"key":"m01-from-a-snapshot-to-a-clock","title":"From a Snapshot to a Clock","lesson_keys":["l01-what-this-tier-adds","l02-two-clocks-one-integrator","l03-the-arrhenius-rate","l04-the-kinetics-panel-map"]},{"key":"m02-the-easy-ro-scheme","title":"The Easy%Ro Scheme","lesson_keys":["l01-twenty-bins","l02-from-f-to-reflectance","l03-the-kinetic-step","l04-the-frequency-factor-and-units","l05-the-published-range"]},{"key":"m03-the-heating-ramp","title":"The Heating Ramp","lesson_keys":["l01-the-ramp-convention","l02-ro-at-150-on-the-capstone-ramp","l03-the-slow-ramp-wins","l04-a-threshold-is-not-a-temperature","l05-the-fast-ramp-and-the-pattern"]},{"key":"m04-the-kerogen-clock","title":"The Kerogen Clock","lesson_keys":["l01-potentials-are-a-spectrum","l02-the-transformation-ratio","l03-the-isothermal-stall","l04-temperature-buys-what-time-cannot","l05-type-one-two-three"]},{"key":"m05-reading-a-maturity","title":"Reading a Maturity","lesson_keys":["l01-windows-are-conventions","l02-what-ro-does-not-say","l03-geometry-errors-become-chemistry-errors","l04-sanity-checks"]},{"key":"m06-the-kinetics-workflow","title":"The Kinetics Workflow","lesson_keys":["l01-the-workflow-end-to-end","l02-quality-control","l03-the-capstone-walkthrough","l04-onward-to-expert"]}]}'::jsonb, 1)
on conflict (app_slug, tier) do update
  set structure = excluded.structure,
      content_version = excluded.content_version,
      active = true,
